Note that the pilot project's Terms of Use also ask that the data not be
"disassembled, reverse engineered, decompiled, modified, or altered". The
upstream pharmaverse packages already rework it, and this product's Parquet
conversion is a format change that reads a blank character as the missing value
it stands for. If a stricter reading of that clause matters to your use case, the
regeneration programs in `data-raw/` rebuild the same datasets from the upstream
sources without shipping Parquet files.

